## REASONING
Mechanical-only contract requires moving cohesive existing code from telemetry_handler.go
into telemetry_handler_live_store.go. The intended scope per this prompt is:
  - L1 SignalStore writes (in-process signal.Store cache)
  - Redis HSET L2 mirror writes (vehicle:{vehicleID}:signals)
  - Redis vehicle_signals pub/sub publishers

